        <h3>Surge Clamp</h3>
        <p>A TVS diode suppresses short voltage spikes before they reach the protected circuit.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="protection-card">
        <span class="protection-index">03</span>
        <h3>Resettable Fuse</h3>
        <p>A polyfuse limits sustained fault current, then resets after the fault is removed and the device cools.</p>
      </article>
